ba16-4ddb7940952b","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"バグバウンティ目的って言いながらマークザッカーバーグのFBアカウントを乗っ取った人とかいましたよね","ts":"1619145148.292600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8sJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7da38511-ba75-49a1-ba54-7141a8a805a0","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"とはいえ、一例をもって全部を判断はできないでしょうけどね...","ts":"1619145129.292000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ewyxK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d13af9d9-1c61-4491-8a39-99bebd91ef71","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"セキュリティバグへの懸賞金システムとかやると一部の研究者の性格の闇が垣間見えるんですよね。","ts":"1619145114.291300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"r4eQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"81fab018-6a19-46e0-8f0f-33e7aef27986","type":"message","user":"UGJG6S9JM","text":"ていうか善意を信じてたらセキュリティは成り立たないんで、しょうがないといいえばそうなんだけど、ううん。","ts":"1619144943.290000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yBg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"af5f3085-04b7-47a6-a26b-67f2b1556bad","type":"message","user":"UGJG6S9JM","text":"逆にみるとこれが研究としてOKで、かつこれくらいのインパクトがないとセキュリティの専門的な研究として成り立たないのれあれば、なんというか前からセキュリティ関係の人の高圧的な態度とか多少問題になっていたけれど業界全体としてどうなのっていう感じは多少あるのかもしれない。もう政治とかに大きなインパクトをもつクリティカルな分野になっているので、倫理観の欠けたことがあってもなんら驚きはないんだけど… なんだろうな悪意に善意が負けていくのが悲しいというか腹立たしい、そんな感じ。","ts":"1619144811.289400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U06BRP8VD"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7m7O"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3a682025-31c8-4dab-9309-6426d1409d62","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"学内の査読とかがそれで通るのかは置いておいて","ts":"1619144653.286900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=bQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f7e0cfd6-d203-4292-a3e8-945e70535693","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"まあやってる事は普通にクソなんですよね\n実験なんてしなくても論文だけ書いてpublishされてれば見る人は見たんじゃないかなと","ts":"1619144556.285600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"o5F"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a729f3bd-1d1d-43e0-9b17-92c0763d8fcb","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"一緒にIWSECのコレも教えてもらった。\n\u003chttps://www.iwsec.org/csec/ethics/checklist.html\u003e","ts":"1619144463.284800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"k73"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1e06aa6f-05ed-4410-8d56-430df8ec535a","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"別の場所でメンロレポートなるものを教えてもらいました。\n\nこんなコンテキストで\n\n\u0026gt; Menlo Report の原則をちゃんと守ってほしい\n\u003chttps://nipponkaigi.net/wiki/Menlo_Report\u003e","ts":"1619144437.284500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wo/4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"584e8366-b5cf-404d-8a29-a985dbd8fee3","type":"message","user":"UGJG6S9JM","text":"特定の研究者の研究成果になるモルモットにされたことには変わりないわけだしなあ","ts":"1619144326.283700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mLL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"DCCA1EDD-E3C3-4086-802A-55054FD9D37E","type":"message","user":"U81LLJ340","text":"学術研究目的と言えど、やってることは少し前にあったTシャツプレゼントのときと変わらないよなあ","ts":"1619144320.283500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oCuu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"357084a9-4201-48a3-9bdb-0b817d3c1445","type":"message","user":"UGJG6S9JM","text":"セキュリティの問題としてもっとマシな方法でcontributeできたはずなのであって、","ts":"1619144280.281800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XEi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"221d0fbe-5d41-4178-b474-393c37653232","type":"message","user":"UGJG6S9JM","text":"結果的に200近いコミットをリバートする羽目になってるわけだし、送ったパッチの数はわずかとか、被害がないようにめっちゃ注意したとかissueでも最初かいてたけど、信用を貶める行為に大いに加担してるわけで、まあ結果issueでは2時間でぼこぼこにされたわけで、まあおなじ研究者としての立場の人は擁護するかもだけど、OSSやってる側としてははぁという気もする。","ts":"1619144216.280400","edited":{"user":"UGJG6S9JM","ts":"1619144237.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KaGQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a7e1a87f-746e-4573-88a3-c51b6bafb8cd","type":"message","user":"UGJG6S9JM","text":"最終的にバンされた理由はそうでも、最初の論文の時点でいろいろ釈明してるので(IRBでOKだった〜)研究と論文の時点でも研究としてはOKでもGregがあのメールでもいってるとおりコミュニティにとってはクソでしかなかったと思う。\n\u0026gt; You, and your group, have publicly admitted to sending known-buggy\n\u0026gt; patches to see how the kernel community would react to them, and\n\u0026gt; published a paper based on that work.","ts":"1619144058.277800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":4,"users":["U8CC7MDCL","U7B4ZD49X","U06BRP8VD","U01AQ5BFNLX"]},{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UAZ33BKV2"]},{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U06BRP8VD"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OlQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a4729555-eabe-4a0c-99d1-4c18eaf46cfc","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"ミネソタ大のあれ、どうやら件の論文自体はあまり関係なくて（きっかけの一つではある）、それとは別の人が送った粗悪なパッチの方でキレたって見方がありますね\nその視点で見ても結局論文の件があったから積み重ねでキレたって話らしいですけど","ts":"1619133219.275400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Cty"}]}]
